        <ul class="anu-terminal-list">
          <li><strong>The Thermodynamic Leak:</strong> Every word spoken mechanically consumes massive amounts of neuro-electric voltage. Continuous, unconscious talking drains the exact energy required for esoteric transubstantiation.</li>
          <li><strong>Starving the Parasite:</strong> The Archontic matrix feeds on the binary conflict and emotional friction generated by terrestrial speech. When you stop talking, you immediately sever a primary feeding tube to the lower astral grid.</li>
